{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:39:05.506707", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with a central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1 to switch_8). Hosts are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The management/control network (20.0.0.0/24) is used for SDN controller communication.\\n\\n#### Findings:\\n1. **Reachability Tests**:\\n   - **Host-to-Host Communication**:\\n     - Host_1 failed to reach Host_2. The status is marked as \"unknown,\" indicating no response or incomplete data for this test.\\n     - Host_6 also failed to reach Host_2, with the status marked as \"unknown.\"\\n     - All other host-to-host communication tests were successful, with no packet loss and reasonable round-trip times (RTTs).\\n   - **RTT Observations**:\\n     - RTTs between hosts vary significantly:\\n       - Some RTTs are low (e.g., Host_1 to Host_8: average RTT ~20.523 ms).\\n       - Others are high (e.g., Host_2 to Host_8: average RTT ~173.64 ms).\\n     - The higher RTTs suggest potential latency issues in certain paths.\\n\\n2. **Anomalies**:\\n   - Host_1 and Host_6 exhibit abnormal behavior as they cannot reach Host_2. This could indicate issues with their respective edge switches (switch_1 and switch_6) or the central switch (switch_0).\\n   - The RTT discrepancies between hosts may point to uneven network performance or congestion in specific paths.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nTo further diagnose the root cause of the anomalies:\\n- Investigate the network configuration and status of switch_1 and switch_6.\\n- Examine the central switch (switch_0) for potential issues affecting connectivity.\\n- Analyze the SDN controller\\'s communication with switches to ensure proper OpenFlow configuration.\\n\\nThis report highlights the need for deeper inspection of the network devices and paths associated with Host_1, Host_6, and Host_2., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='ad88f733-5287-4031-9408-88ad1ef77589'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
